A "PRODUCTION-READY POD" CHECKLIST
----------------------------------
[ ] requests set (cpu + memory), memory limit set
[ ] readiness + liveness (+ startup if slow) probes
[ ] preStop delay for graceful shutdown
[ ] runs as non-root, drop ALL caps, no privilege escalation,
    read-only root FS where possible
[ ] own ServiceAccount, token only if needed, least-privilege RBAC
[ ] NetworkPolicy allowing only required traffic
[ ] replicas spread across nodes/zones (anti-affinity/topology spread)
[ ] PodDisruptionBudget
[ ] image pinned to a version tag (or digest)


